# Agit02Gustav (35410), Agit02Dietrich (35408) and Agit02Mikhail (35409), raised bare: each
# shouts its line as it appears (sent as the NPC lines' NPCs spawn, before the first step). A
# kill of a dead one kills a fresh one, which shouts as it appears; none of them has a dying
# line. Gustav's privates' templates are not served, so he raises none. Their party, see-spell
# and skill-finished hooks need a party and casts the format cannot render
# (tests/ai/hall_agit02_test.go covers them).
character Hunter 20
random always 1
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.Agit02Dietrich
script script.ai.siegablehall.Agit02Gustav
script script.ai.siegablehall.Agit02Mikhail
npc gustav 35410 Monster 40 0 0
npc dietrich 35408 Monster 0 40 0
npc mikhail 35409 Monster 0 -40 0

kill gustav x2
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S NpcSay obj=gustav type=1 npc=1035410 text="Prepare to die, foreign invaders! I am Gustav, the eternal ruler of this fortress and I have taken up my sword to repel thee!"
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
kill dietrich x2
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S NpcSay obj=dietrich type=1 npc=1035408 text="Soldiers of Gustav, go forth and destroy the invaders!"
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
kill mikhail x2
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S NpcSay obj=mikhail type=1 npc=1035409 text="Glory to Aden, the Kingdom of the Lion! Glory to Sir Gustav, our immortal lord!"
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
